### CRA-38 — Electronic Monitoring Status Validation (DR-EMON-017)
### Run against local service on port 4550

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4550
@userId = test-user

### AC2 — Error: EM-flagged offence with IMP result, no continuing/ending result → ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/validation/validate
Content-Type: application/json
CJSCPPUID: {{userId}}
CPP-ACTION: validation-service.validate

{
  "hearingId": "h-emon-local-ac2",
  "hearingDay": "2026-11-18",
  "courtType": "MAGISTRATES",
  "resultLines": [
    {"resultLineId": "rl1", "shortCode": "IMP", "category": "F",
     "label": "Imprisonment",
     "defendantId": "d1", "offenceId": "off-1"}
  ],
  "defendants": [{"defendantId": "d1", "firstName": "John", "lastName": "Smith"}],
  "offences": [
    {"offenceId": "off-1", "defendantId": "d1", "offenceCode": "CD98001",
     "offenceTitle": "Theft", "orderIndex": 1,
     "hasActiveElectronicMonitoring": true}
  ]
}

